{"title":"Friday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/931539674/0/marginalrevolution~Friday-assorted-links.html","date":1764954409000,"content":"<p>1. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.ft.com/content/15561b18-a044-4588-92d0-92e185721790\" target=\"_blank\">Best DC art works?</a> (FT)  Surely Manet’s <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nga.gov/artworks/43624-railway\" target=\"_blank\">The Railway</a> should be on the list?  Does Dulles Airport count?  The Iwo Jima Memorial or Vietnam Memorial?  Maybe even the Air Force Memorial?</p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/CollinRugg/status/1996000721297347062\" target=\"_blank\">The raccoon culture that was Virginia and I suppose still is a little bit?</a></p>\r\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://thepursuitofliberalism.substack.com/p/stoppards-liberalism\" target=\"_blank\">Stoppard’s liberal individualism</a>.</p>\r\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.academia.edu/32674928/Introduction_What_is_Conservative_Social_and_Political_Thought\" target=\"_blank\">Jerry Z Muller on conservatism</a>.</p>\r\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/speakukorg/status/1996217869307199527\" target=\"_blank\">SPEAK, new organization for free speech in the UK</a>.</p>\r\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.astralcodexten.com/p/the-good-news-is-that-one-side-has?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=89120&amp;post_id=179807181&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=false&amp;r=3o9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\">On heritability debates</a>.  And <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/sapinker/status/199628277